@startuml j1-first-visit-and-ask
!include style.iuml
title J1 First visit and ask
actor Patient
participant "Chat page\n(index.html, chat.js)" as Chat
participant "core.js" as Core
database "localStorage" as LS
participant "api/chat\n(Vercel)" as API
participant "OpenRouter\n(DeepSeek)" as OR
autonumber

Patient -> Chat : opens / (or /?q=<question>)
Chat -> Core : FD.getLang(), FD.patientId(), FD.applyTheme()
Core -> LS : read frontdesk.lang, frontdesk.patient, frontdesk.theme
Core -> LS : write a new patient id (P + 5 characters) when none is stored
Chat -> API : GET /api/chat (warm-up; the body is read and dropped)
API --> Chat : 200 {ok: true}
Chat -> Core : FD.loadClinic()
Core -> Core : fetch /clinic-data.json\n(window.FRONTDESK_CLINIC if the fetch fails)
Core -> LS : read frontdesk.clinic
note right of Core : an edited file with a "clinic" section wins over the shipped one
Core --> Chat : clinic data
Chat -> Chat : side(), labels(), render()
note right of Chat
The greeting is #greeting (.bot-greeting in
.greeting-row), never .bot-msg. render() keeps it
and redraws this patient's earlier tickets.
end note

opt the address has ?q=
  Chat -> Chat : history.replaceState() removes q, then send(q)
  note right of Chat : q is removed before sending, so a reload does not ask again
end

Patient -> Chat : types a question and presses Send, or taps a quick chip
Chat -> Chat : provisional user line, pending + 1, showTyping(true)
note right of Chat : the typing dots are .typing-row, never .bot-msg
Chat -> Core : FD.answer(q, data)
Core --> Chat : {kind, status, text, lang, facts, bookingTime, modelOk}

alt kind "answer" and modelOk (a reply built from the file)
  Chat -> API : POST /api/chat {draft, facts, lang, clinic}\nAbortController stops the call after 6 s
  API -> OR : chat/completions, deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash,\ntemperature 0.2, reasoning off, 5 s limit
  note right of API
  Sent: the rules, the DRAFT and the clinic file.
  The patient's words are never sent.
  end note
  OR --> API : reworded answer
  API --> Chat : 200 {text, model}
  Chat -> Core : FD.guard(text, ruled, data)
  alt guard passes
    Core --> Chat : true: reply is the model text, source "model"
  else guard fails
    Core --> Chat : false: reply is the rules text, source "file"
  end
else greeting, thanks, safety reply, booking or not sure
  note over Chat : askModel() returns null at once; no call to api/chat
end

Chat -> Core : FD.openNow(data)
Chat -> Core : FD.addTicket({patient, q, reply, source, kind, status, lang,\nbookingTime, afterHours, afterHoursNote, callBack})
Core -> LS : read frontdesk.tickets, add the ticket, write frontdesk.tickets
Core --> Chat : ticket {id, created, staffReplies: [], saved}
Chat -> Chat : remove the provisional line; showTyping(false) when nothing is pending
Chat -> Chat : ticketRows(t): .user-msg, then the reply as the last .bot-msg
note right of Chat
.src-label "Answered from the clinic file" when the
source is not "model". A Listen button sits beside
the reply when speechSynthesis exists.
end note
Chat --> Patient : one complete reply
@enduml
